          deckDescription: 'A 32-card pack stripped from a standard French deck: Ace, King, Queen, Jack, 10, 9, 8, and 7 in each of the four suits (Hearts, Diamonds, Clubs, Spades). Used for German Solo and many European trick-taking games.',
          suitDescription: 'French suits: Hearts, Diamonds, Clubs, and Spades. All four suits are used in the 32-card pack with no special suit order or preference; trump is chosen by the bid winner each hand.',
